     ssttaattuuss [--rr] [_i_d]
             List VMs running on the host, optionally listing just the se‐
             lected VM _i_d.  If the --rr flag is present, the output will only
             contain running VMs.

     ssttoopp [--ffww] [--aa | _i_d]
             Stop (terminate) a VM defined by the specified VM _i_d or all run‐
             ning VMs (--aa).  By default, a graceful shutdown will be attempted
             if the VM supports the vmmci(4) device.

             The following options can be specified when stopping a VM:

             --ff  Forcefully stop the VM without attempting a graceful shut‐
                 down.

             --ww  Wait until the VM has been terminated.

     uunnppaauussee _i_d
             Unpause (resume from a paused state) a VM with the specified _i_d.

     wwaaiitt _i_d
